# nolimit-visual-studio

A refined Higgsfield-inspired homepage and studio site prototype built with Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, GSAP and Lenis.

## Local development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Visit http://localhost:3000

## Notes

- Built for a dark, premium AI brand aesthetic with lime accent accents.
- Scroll animations and smooth motion are enabled and tuned for a high-end landing-page feel.
- Includes a secondary about page and contact page for navigation completeness.

## Deploy

Recommended: Vercel
